    "questionNumber": 49,
    "section": "SAT Practice 4 - May 22, 2026",
    "text": "Reading and Writing: Question 22The life spans of rockfish vary greatly by species. For instance, the colorful calico rockfish (Sebastes dallii) can survive for a little over a ______blank the rougheye rockfish (Sebastes aleutianus) boasts a maximum life span of about two centuries. Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?decade: whiledecade. Whiledecade; whiledecade, while",
    "html": "<h3 class=\"cb-margin-bottom-16\">Reading and Writing: Question 22</h3><div class=\"cb-margin-bottom-16\"><p>The life spans of rockfish vary greatly by species. For instance, the colorful calico rockfish (<em>Sebastes dallii</em>) can survive for a little over a <span aria-hidden=\"true\">______</span><span class=\"sr-only\">blank</span> the rougheye rockfish (<em>Sebastes aleutianus</em>) boasts a maximum life span of about two centuries.&nbsp;</p></div><div><p>Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?</p></div><ol type=\"A\" class=\"answer-options cb-margin-top-16\"><li class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><p>decade<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">:</span> while</p></div></li><li class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><p>decade<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">.</span> While</p></div></li><li class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><p>decade<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">;</span> while</p></div></li><li class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><p>decade<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span> while</p></div></li></ol>"
